<title>UK: Pemex sets 350 billion lire FRN due 2004.</title>
<headline>Pemex sets 350 billion lire FRN due 2004.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate</p>
<p>issue was announced by lead manager J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   PETROLEOS MEXICANOS (PEMEX)</p>
<p> AMT    350 BLN ITL   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	.APR.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +165 BP   PAY DATE    14.APR.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY BA2	 ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   80 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   BB	  REOFFER    99.75</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (M) 5	   SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  MEXICO    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    25 BP     SELL CONC  55 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	BCI IS JOINT LEAD MANAGER</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
